{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49865","headline":"蝶恋花 三 · 冯延巳","name":"蝶恋花 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几度凤楼同饮宴，此夕相逢，却胜当时见。\n低语前欢频转面，双眉歛恨春山远。\n蜡烛泪流羌笛怨，偷整罗衣，欲唱情犹嬾。\n醉里不辞金爵满，阳关一曲肠千断。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49865.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49865","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}